{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん♪\n無事富士山登頂しましたー(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこで2週に渡って\n10thシングルのヒット祈願が\n放送されましたが、\n今回のヒット祈願は富士登山！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までいろいろなヒット祈願を\nしてきたけれど正直\nスカイダイビングの何倍も\n過酷でした(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、メンバーと一緒に登った\nからこそあんなに大変なことでも\n成し遂げることができたんだな\nと改めてメンバーの心強さを\n感じました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは富士登山写真館\nご覧くださーい(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/10/06/7437397/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"準備運動して出発〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/10/06/7437397/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ余裕っ｀‐ω‐´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/10/06/7437397/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終始元気だった運動音痴コンビ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/10/06/7437397/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サングラスでROCKな未央奈♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/10/06/7437397/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雲が下にあるよ〜(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/10/06/7437397/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっとラーメンにありつけた♡\nおでこ全開///（笑）おいし〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/10/06/7437397/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頂上までは一緒に行けなかったけど\n気持ちはずっと一緒だった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/10/06/7437397/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに登頂っ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/10/06/7437397/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"登頂のご褒美に見れた綺麗すぎる空♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/10/06/7437397/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"想像以上に辛かった\n下山中の夕焼け（笑）\nちなみに私の待ち受け画面これ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/10/06/7437397/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に富士山メロンパンも\n食べたよ(σ･ω･)σ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！オフショットでした〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天候も優れず、過酷なヒット祈願\nだったけどより一層グループの結束を\n強められたような気がして、最初は\nすごーく嫌がっていたけど（笑）\nこうやって無事ヒット祈願できて\nよかったです(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10枚目は私たちにとっても\n勝負の時。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで足並み揃えてグーーンッ！\nと乃木坂が富士山みたいに高く、\n日本一に近づけるように\nこれからも頑張りますっ(`･v･´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルグループと言ったら\n「乃木坂46」って言われるくらい\n上を目指しますヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせtime(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10/10発売のFINE BOYSに\n出させていただきます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段とは違った女子大生らしい\n雰囲気を見てください(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうひとつ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の夜中の25:29〜25:59に\nNOGIBINGO!3がスタートします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1,2を経て、また3として\n帰ってこれたことが\nめっちゃ嬉しいですヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前収録してきたけど\n今回も面白い\\( ^^)/\\(^^ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初回はまいまいと美彩と私が\n超〜密着していたり、ラブラブな\nまいやんまっちゅんが観れたり...♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜遅いけどちょっぴり夜更かしして\nのぎちゃんたちを見てくれたら\n嬉しいなぁ(。-ω-)｡°｡°｡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お見逃し無くっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/10/06/7437397/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわっ"}],"source":"archive"}